[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:19. Tired and Thirsty]
[00:00.540]Lesson 19. | 第19课。
[00:02.385]What's the matter, children? | 怎么了，孩子们？
[00:05.005]We're tired and thirsty, Mum. | 我们又累又渴，妈妈。
[00:08.425]Sit down here. | 坐下。
[00:11.445]Are you all right now? | 你们现在好些了吗？
[00:14.090]No, we aren't. | 没有，我们没有。
[00:16.655]Look! | 看！
[00:18.335]There's an ice cream man. | 有个卖冰淇淋的。
[00:21.850]Two ice creams, please. | 请来两个冰淇淋。
[00:26.100]Here you are, children. | 孩子们，给你们。
[00:28.765]Thanks, Mum. | 谢谢妈妈。
[00:30.635]These ice creams are nice. | 这些冰淇淋真好吃。
[00:34.075]Are you all right now? | 你们现在好些了吗？
[00:36.665]Yes, we are. Thank you. | 是的，我们好多了。谢谢。